          "html_url": "https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/commit/794a753958a7d4c03d6deadd6740d32d9bd6dbb5"
        }
      ],
      "message": "rpc: add bestblockhash to getmininginfo\n\nMining software building a block template from getmininginfo's `next`\nobject (next height, nBits, target) also needs the hash of the tip that\n`next` was derived from. Today that requires a second call\n(getblockchaininfo or getbestblockhash), which can race with a tip\nchange - notably a same-height reorg at a retarget boundary, where the\ntwo competing tips imply different next nBits.\n\nReturn the tip hash from getmininginfo itself so all values come from\nthe same tip under a single cs_main lock.",
      "committer": {
        "name": "Jakub Trnka",
        "email": "jakub.trnka@braiins.cz",
        "date": "2026-08-26T08:16:56Z"
      },
      "author": {
        "name": "Jakub Trnka",
        "email": "jakub.trnka@braiins.cz",
        "date": "2026-08-25T15:49:57Z"
